# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub Repository Lore Generator — Environment Variables
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The app is fully stateless and requires NO database and NO user accounts.
#
# The single optional variable below is a GitHub Personal Access Token. It is
# used ONLY to raise the GitHub API rate limit from 60 requests/hour
# (unauthenticated) to 5,000 requests/hour. No scopes are required — a
# "read-only / public access" fine-grained token or a classic token with no
# scopes is enough. The token is read on the SERVER only and is never sent to
# the browser.
#
# Create one at: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

GITHUB_TOKEN=

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTIONAL — AI prose enhancement (any OpenAI-compatible provider)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The lore is generated by a deterministic engine and works fully WITHOUT this.
# If configured, an "AI prose" toggle appears on each report that rewrites the
# narrative's wording in its chosen voice (it is instructed never to change
# facts). Everything is read on the SERVER only. Leave blank to disable.
#
# It works with ANY provider that speaks the OpenAI chat-completions API — set
# OPENAI_BASE_URL + OPENAI_MODEL + (optional) OPENAI_API_KEY. Pick a FREE one:
#
#   ── OpenAI (paid) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
#   OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
#   OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
#
#   ── Groq (free, fast, no card) — https://console.groq.com/keys ──
#   OPENAI_API_KEY=gsk_...
#   OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
#   OPENAI_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
#
#   ── Google Gemini (free tier) — https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#   OPENAI_API_KEY=AIza...
#   OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai/
#   OPENAI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
#
#   ── OpenRouter (has :free models) — https://openrouter.ai/keys ──
#   OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-or-...
#   OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
#   OPENAI_MODEL=meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free
#
#   ── Ollama (100% local, no key needed) — https://ollama.com ─────
#   OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
#   OPENAI_MODEL=llama3.2
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
